'''Manbosaki Strikes!''' (ハマンボ崎あゆみ強襲！''Hamanbo Saki Ayumi Kyōshū'') is a [[Survive! Mola Mola! Collaboration Event|Survive! Mola Mola!]] collaboration stage added in the [[Version 11.7 Update]].

==Overview==
===About===
Manbosaki Strikes! contains a total of 20 [[No Continues]] stages, called '''Sudden Deaths''' (突然の死 Lvs.). After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of a stage can include XP, [[Battle Items]] and [[Cat Capsule|Tickets]]. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event. Every Sudden Death plays out the same, but the strength magnifications and enemy base's HP are increased with each level.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[Manbosaki Strikes!/Sudden Death Lv.1~20]].''

==Play Requirements==
*Manbosaki Strikes! can be played at any time during the collaboration period.

